flowchart TD
    classDef process fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#172554
    classDef store fill:#fefce8,stroke:#a16207,color:#422006
    classDef failure fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef external fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c,color:#431407

    Start[Every 5 seconds:<br/>publisher loop selects up to 10]:::process
    Outbox[(outbox_effects)]:::store
    Claim[Claim pending effects]:::process
    Send[Send effect with deterministic effect ID]:::process
    Destination[HTTP or fake destination]:::external
    Success{Delivered?}:::process
    Delivered[Mark delivered]:::process
    Retry{Attempts remaining?}:::process
    Schedule[Schedule exponential-backoff retry<br/>and return to pending]:::failure
    Quarantine[Quarantine effect]:::failure
    Q[(quarantine)]:::store

    Start --> Claim
    Outbox -->|pending effects| Claim --> Send --> Destination --> Success
    Success -->|yes| Delivered --> Outbox
    Success -->|no| Retry
    Retry -->|yes| Schedule --> Outbox
    Retry -->|no| Quarantine --> Q
    Note[The outbox is committed with the execution.<br/>The destination must treat effect ID as an idempotency key.]:::process
